      "stem": "The department in which you are a purchasing clerk consists of a general manager and her secretary; an accountant/buyer who reports to the general manager. The purchasing clerk, accounts clerk and payroll clerk are all in the same salary range. The secretary coordinates the duties of the office attendant.",
