    "OA-P2-2005-MJ::3": {
      "stem": "After a successful interview you received the following letter:\n\nWAREHOUSING LTD\nMatherson Avenue, Fallaway, St. Vincent\n\nJune 15, 2005\n\nJade Hackshaw\n27 Cedar Hill\nSoufriere\nSt. Vincent\n\nDear Jade\n\nI am pleased to offer you a position with WAREHOUSING LTD as an Inventory Clerk in the Stores Department as of July 1, 2005.\n\nYou will report directly to Mr. Matthew, the Warehouse Manager, at 8:00 a.m. Your appointment is at Grade III on the salary scale. Your gross salary will be EC$24 000 annually. You will be paid on a monthly basis. In addition you will be entitled to sixteen (16) days paid annual vacation leave.\n\nI am confident that you will make an excellent addition to the firm, and therefore I bid you welcome.\n\nShould you have any questions, please do not hesitate to call me.\n\nSincerely,\n\nPetra Joinville\n\nHuman Resource Manager",
